<title>SRI LANKA: PAKISTAN 30 FOR 2 AT LUNCH V SRI LANKA.</title>
<headline>PAKISTAN 30 FOR 2 AT LUNCH V SRI LANKA.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan were 30 for 2 in their first innings at lunch in reply to Sri Lanka's 331 all out on the second day of the second and final test match in Colombo on Sunday.</p>
</text>
